{"t":"Kha'labal","s":"kha-labal-dbd5a","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png","q":4,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div style=\"float: right;\"><div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-1\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 256px; height: 256px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -1591px;left:-1302px;clip:rect(1591px 1558px 1847px 1302px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 7\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"2048\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\" width=\"2560\"/></span></span>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:256px;width:128px;left:0px;top:0px;border-right:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:128px;width:256px;left:0px;top:0px;border-bottom:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33174,32695,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33174, 32695, 7)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p>This is the desert surrounding <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>. It was once a lush and fertile region until the great battle during the civil war of the Djinns left the entire area barren and dry. The Ashta'Daramai Library retains a chronicle of the ancient war.\n</p><p>On the surface, there are very few structures, and sparse packs of <a href=\"#/wiki/Hyaena\">Hyaenas</a>, bands of <a href=\"#/wiki/Nomad%20%28Basic%29\">Nomads</a>, and small herds of <a href=\"#/wiki/Deer\">Deer</a>, but under the surface are vast hidden <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun%20Tombs\">tombs</a> of <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Undead</a> creatures and the resting places of the great <a href=\"#/wiki/Pharaohs\">Pharaohs</a>. There are also large caves with <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larva</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab\">Scarabs</a> under the sand.\n</p></div>","quests":["nightmare-isles-mini-world-change","nightmare-teddy-quest","nomads-mini-world-change","realm-of-dreams-quest"]}